{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中煤能源上半年多賺近一成二，純利81.9億元人民幣。中期息每股18.4分人民幣。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">期內收入731.3億人民幣，按年減少百分之1.7。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-22T00:19:38.735357+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":66,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}